Article 88 | Rights and Responsibilities of the Ministry of Technology and Communications

In cybersecurity work management, the Ministry of Technology and Communications has the rights and responsibilities:

1. To research, formulate and improve policies, laws, strategic plans and procedures concerning cybersecurity work for submission to the government for consideration;

2. To expand policies, laws, strategic plans and procedures concerning cybersecurity work into plans, programmes, projects and implementation;

3. To publicize and disseminate policies, laws, strategic plans and procedures concerning cybersecurity work;

4. To issue agreements, orders, and directives concerning cybersecurity work;

5. To formulate and develop cybersecurity standards;

6. To manage, monitor and inspect the implementation of cybersecurity work and resolve problems that arise within the national scope;

7. To establish and manage a national cybersecurity operations system with adequate preparation of qualified personnel and equipment;

8. To report to the government on cybersecurity emergency situations;

9. To research and consider cybersecurity incident reports;

10. To issue, suspend or revoke licenses for conducting business related to cybersecurity;

11. To research the determination, assessment or review of basic infrastructure and important national information data for submission to the government for consideration at each stage;

12. To establish, maintain, improve and develop personnel concerning cybersecurity work;

13. To research, develop and apply cybersecurity technology;

14. To raise awareness and understanding concerning cybersecurity work among society;

15. To receive, consider and address complaints from individuals, legal entities or organizations concerning cybersecurity work;

16. To coordinate with ministries, agencies, local government organizations and relevant sectors concerning cybersecurity work;

17. To maintain relations and cooperate with foreign countries, regional and international organizations concerning cybersecurity work;

